## Step 8 — Confirm Completion

After writing all files, report:
- List of files written: `agents/design/examples/{api-name}.md` (one per API)
- Total number of APIs documented
- Number of Confluence pages used as enrichment context (0 if Step 5 was skipped)
- Number of TBC fields across all files (approximate)
- A one-sentence description of the business use case covered by the notebook

> These files are initial drafts ready for developer review. Once the API project is implemented, run `/use-docs` against the project code to complete all TBC fields and generate the full Confluence HTML + Word output.
> Reference files via `@agents/design/examples/{api-name}.md` in `/use-raml` and `/use-develop` agent chats.
